    description: "Printed 80-81, and the same as every Lemurian''s; see the Lemurian race for the full text. Life Sense: 25 foot (7.6 m) radius plus 5 feet (1.5 m) per level; 20% +5% per level to locate, track or find a specific type of animal or plant, +5% underwater. Empathy with Animals: an automatic affinity with animals of all kinds except monsters, predators and sentient creatures. Ley Line Powers: heals and recovers P.P.E. twice as fast as a normal human on a ley line or at stone pyramids, and swims 25% faster along ley lines. Natural Abilities: as all Lemurians. Ultrasonic Communication: hears and makes high frequency sounds to communicate, 2,000 feet (610 m) underwater and 400 feet (122 m) on the surface or in the air."
  - name: "Water Based Psionic Powers"
    description: "A Spouter cannot create water. Every Hydro-Psionic ability works on water that already exists and lies within that ability''s range. The Hydro-Psionics and Hydro-Super-Psionics are exclusive to the Spouter. Starts with Hold Breath, Hydro-Propulsion and Sense Water, 1D4+1 more Hydro-Psionics of choice and one Hydro-Super-Psionic; then one Hydro-Psionic at each new level and one Hydro-Super-Psionic at levels 3, 5, 8, 10 and 13."
  - name: "The Influence of Ley Line Energy"
    description: "On a ley line or within one mile (1.6 km) of one, the duration and range of the Spouter''s water abilities and other psychic powers are increased by 50%. At a ley line nexus the duration, range and damage of the powers are doubled."
