    description: "Stored on the sheet: +2D6 S.D.C., +1 to save vs magic illusions and possession, and +1 to save vs Horror Factor at levels 1, 3, 6, 9, 12 and 15. Conditional, so not stored: +3 to Perception Rolls involving water and psionics, and +1 to parry and dodge while in the water or using water."
  - name: "Symbiotes, War Steed and Companion"
    description: "The book gives any 1D4 Symbiotic Bio-Constructs of choice that are not weapons, beside the Living Saddle; the equipment list holds a pick of one, the fewest the roll can give, and the rest are added by hand. Not on the equipment list: one Lemurian War Steed suitable for land and water travel (player''s choice), or instead a steed that is mostly or entirely a sea creature. Likely one small animal companion, typically an Aquatic Lemur, but it can be anything."
  - name: "Other Standard Equipment"
    description: "Carried, and without a catalog row: a box of wooden matches, a mess kit, a fishing kit and collapsible pole, 2D6+6 plastic specimen bags, a pocket notebook, and various common personal items. A particular mission or situation can also come with extra or specialised gear, weapons and vehicles issued for it, which happens most often to Spouters serving in the military (printed 82)."
